WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Speaker 1: Welcome to the meeting. Today, we will discuss our project updates.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Speaker 2: Thank you for having me. I have some exciting news to share.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Speaker 1: Great! Let's start with your updates.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Speaker 2: We have completed the initial phase of the project ahead of schedule.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Speaker 1: That's fantastic! What are the next steps?

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Speaker 2: We will begin the testing phase next week and aim for a demo by the end of the month.